         "prompt": "Let \\( y = f(x) \\) be the particular solution to \\( \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = (2x + 1)e^{-y} \\) with the initial condition \\( f(0) = 0 \\). Use separation of variables to find \\( f(x) \\).",
