               "text": "Antidifferentiate both sides.",
               "latex": "e^{y} = x^{2} + x + C"
            },
            {
               "text": "Use f(0) = 0.",
               "latex": "e^{0} = 0 + 0 + C, \\quad C = 1"
            },
            {
               "text": "Solve for y; x^2 + x + 1 > 0 for every x.",
