      {
         "id": "b",
         "prompt": "Let \\( z = h(x) \\) be the particular solution to \\( \\dfrac{dz}{dx} = (2x + 1)z \\) with the initial condition \\( h(0) = 3 \\). Use separation of variables to find \\( h(x) \\).",
         "setup_required": false,
