      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "Let \\( A \\) be the function with \\( A'(x) = e^{f(x)} \\) for all \\( x \\) and \\( A(0) = 2 \\), where \\( f \\) is the function from part (a). Find \\( A(3) \\).",
